# Barcodes: data of several lines in Content, here the QR code of a SEPA credit transfer (EPC).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Barcodes · Data in several lines
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Section:
		Text: Barcodes
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Data in several lines
		Paragraph: Data with line breaks goes in a `Content` block (`>>`) instead of the value, with its lines as they are, empty ones included. The QR code of a SEPA transfer that banking apps read has one field per line.
			Style: intro
		Stack:
			Gap: 20
			Vertical: top
			Item:
				Barcode:
					Alt: QR code to pay invoice 2026-0147 by transfer
					Box:
						Width: 40mm
					Content >>
						BCD
						002
						1
						SCT
						CAIXESBBXXX
						Taller Nogal S.L.
						ES9121000418450200051332
						EUR1336.82


						Invoice 2026-0147
